  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "B案和C案都不错，\n不过我们还是用A案吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00426848548C0043684890FD4E0D9519FF0C000A4E0D8FC762114EEC8FD8662F7528004168485427FF1F00100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "比起缺乏冲击力的A案和C案，\n不如用我的B案如何？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD48D777F3A4E4F51B251FB529B768400416848548C00436848FF0C000A4E0D59827528621176840042684859824F55FF1F00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的C案才是最好的。\n大家都不肯让步啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768400436848624D662F6700597D76843002000A59275BB690FD4E0D80AF8BA96B65554A300200100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要不这样如何？\n我们听听那位年轻人的意见吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E0D8FD9683759824F55FF1F000A62114EEC542C542C90A34F4D5E748F7B4EBA7684610F89C15427300200100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好主意！只有我们3个人的话，\n就是在原地打转啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D4E3B610FFF0153EA670962114EEC00334E2A4EBA76848BDDFF0C000A5C31662F5728539F573062538F6C554A300200100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "年轻人，对，就是你。\n你能帮我们个小忙吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E748F7B4EBAFF0C5BF9FF0C5C31662F4F603002000A4F6080FD5E2E62114EEC4E2A5C0F5FD95417FF1F00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这条街道现在虽然也不赖，\n但是缺乏亮点……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD967618857905373B05728867D71364E5F4E0D8D56FF0C000A4F46662F7F3A4E4F4EAE70B92026202600100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是我们想给它取个名字\n来吸引大家的眼球，让这里热闹起来。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F62114EEC60F37ED95B8353D64E2A540D5B57000A676554385F1559275BB67684773C7403FF0C8BA98FD991CC70ED95F98D776765300200100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，请让我们听听你的意见吧。\n毕竟年轻人肩负着城市的未来嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C8BF78BA962114EEC542C542C4F607684610F89C154273002000A6BD57ADF5E748F7B4EBA80A98D1F774057CE5E027684672A6765561B300200100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了，我们几个想出来的\n街道名是这样的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF0C62114EEC51E04E2A60F351FA67657684000A88579053540D662F8FD968377684300200100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A案：<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大密阿雷大道<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n取一个比较夸张的名字，\n应该能让大家有所期待。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00416848FF1A00100002FF00000659275BC6963F96F75927905300100002FF000000300200100001BE01000A53D64E004E2A6BD48F8359385F207684540D5B57FF0C000A5E948BE580FD8BA959275BB667096240671F5F85300200100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "B案：<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>超级进化大道<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n当然和超级进化并没有什么关系，\n但这就是我的提案。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00426848FF1A00100002FF0000068D857EA78FDB53165927905300100002FF000000300200100001BE01000A5F537136548C8D857EA78FDB53165E766CA167094EC04E4851737CFBFF0C000A4F468FD95C31662F6211768463D06848300200100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C案：<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>津津乐道<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这名字让人津津乐道。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00436848FF1A00100002FF0000066D256D254E50905300100002FF000000300200100001BE01000A8FD9540D5B578BA94EBA6D256D254E509053300200100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每个名字都不错吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n所以才害得我们像火、水、草\n这3种属性一样互不相让。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF4E2A540D5B5790FD4E0D95195427FF1F00100001BE01000A62404EE5624D5BB35F9762114EEC50CF706B30016C3430018349000A8FD9003379CD5C5E60274E0068374E924E0D76F88BA9300200100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何？可以请你告诉我们\n哪个名字比较好吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF1F53EF4EE58BF74F60544A8BC962114EEC000A54EA4E2A540D5B576BD48F83597D5417FF1F00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
