      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D256D254E509053300200100001BE01000A8FD9540D5B578BA94EBA6D256D254E509053300200100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没想到A案、B案、C案你都不用，\n反而提出了自己的方案……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
